<title>UK: London fertiliser fixtures.</title>
<headline>London fertiliser fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aggeliki P - 50,000 tonnes dap USG/China July/Aug $22.75 fio 25 days shinc Conagra.</p>
<p>Anthi P - 55,000/10 tonnes dap Donaldsonville/China 20/30 July $23.95 fio 25 days shinc Great Pacific.</p>
</text>
